<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Your Product Was Rejected</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f5f5f5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
      .container { width: 100%; max-width: 640px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
      .header { background: #dc2626; padding: 40px 24px; text-align: center; color: #fff; }
      .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
      .content { padding: 36px 30px; color: #111827; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; }
      .notice { background: #fef2f2; border-left: 4px solid #dc2626; padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 24px 0; color: #991b1b; }
      .details { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0 28px; }
      .details td { padding: 10px 0; vertical-align: top; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-size: 14px; }
      .details td:first-child { color: #6b7280; width: 40%; padding-right: 16px; }
      .footer { background: #f9fafb; text-align: center; padding: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Your Product Was Rejected</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <p>Hi {{ sellerName }},</p>
        <p>Your product was reviewed by the admin team and was not approved at this time.</p>
        <div class="notice">
          <strong>Rejection reason</strong>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0 0;">{{ rejectionReason }}</p>
        </div>
        <table class="details">
          <tr><td>Product name</td><td>{{ productName }}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Price</td><td>{{ productPrice }}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Description</td><td>{{ productDescription }}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Category</td><td>{{ productCategory }}</td></tr>
        </table>
        <p>Please review the feedback, update your product if needed, and submit it again.</p>
        <p>Best regards,<br />The DOJU Team</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        You are receiving this email because one of your products was reviewed on DOJU.
        <br /><br />
        (c) 2026 DOJU
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
